WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.410
The Earth, and the Moon going round it.

00:03.110 --> 00:09.541
The Moon goes round the Earth every 27.3 days, which here is four and a half seconds.

00:09.991 --> 00:18.466
The camera is riding along with the Earth at thirty kilometres a second, so it is everything farther away that seems to drift.
